        "heading": "<p>We regularly create custom pieces for private and commercial clients. Some are after an existing design in a different finish, while others want something entirely individual. Our studio in Litchfield, Connecticut, is a fully functioning one, so as long as what you want to make fits inside our kiln, we'd be happy to create it for you</p>",
